msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are looking for Jakarta REST, Servlet or Vert.x support for Google "
"Cloud Functions, we have it thanks to our xref:gcp-functions-http."
"adoc[Google Cloud Functions HTTP binding]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are looking for a provider-agnostic implementation of your Google "
"Cloud Functions, we have it thanks to our xref:funqy-gcp-functions."
"adoc[Funqy Google Cloud Functions extension]."
msgstr ""
